<title>USA: Everen Capital Corp Q1 net rises, revs off.</title>
<headline>Everen Capital Corp Q1 net rises, revs off.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			 $ 0.58		   $ 0.41</p>
<p> Net			 10,102		    6,806</p>
<p> Revs		     131,311		  133,887</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  17,449		   16,561</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q1 results presented on a proforma basis as if the company's initial public offering in October 1996 had occurred at the beginning of 1996.  </p>
<p>1996 Q1 revenues include $9.3 million from certain non-strategic businesses which subsequently were sold or discontinued.</p>
<p>		((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
